# rfipconfig-be Runtime Image Build — Shipwright Migration Runbook
# rfipconfig-be 런타임 이미지 빌드 — Shipwright 마이그레이션 런북

> **English first, 한국어는 아래 ([바로가기](#한국어-korean))**
> Replaces legacy BuildConfig `rfipconfig-be-#{JENKINS_TAG}#` (inline Dockerfile + chained image) with a Shipwright two-Build sequence: **S2I builder image → buildah runtime image**.

---

## English

### Prerequisites (already done — verify only)

| Check | Command | Expected |
|---|---|---|
| S2I build works | `oc get builds.shipwright.io rfipconfig-be-s2i-build -n openshift-builds` | Exists, registered |
| SA + RBAC | `oc get rolebinding rb-pipeline-image-builder -n openshift-builds` | Exists (`system:image-builder` → `pipeline`) |
| Push secret | `oc get secret pipeline-push-secret -n openshift-builds -o jsonpath='{.type}'` | `kubernetes.io/dockerconfigjson` (NOT service-account-token) |
| CA configMap | `oc get configmap hobbylobby.corp -n openshift-builds` | Exists |

