### Troubleshooting quick reference

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `x509: certificate signed by unknown authority` | CA not mounted / not extracted | Verify Step 2 edits #3–#5; confirm `SSL_CERT_FILE` env in Build CR |
| `unauthorized: authentication required` on push | Wrong secret type | `pushSecret` must be `kubernetes.io/dockerconfigjson` (`oc create secret docker-registry ...`), not SA token |
| Runtime build can't pull builder image | S2I output name mismatch | Step 0 — S2I must push `rfipconfig-be-builder:latest` |
| `oc get build` shows nothing / wrong kind | CRD name collision | Always `oc get builds.shipwright.io` |
| `oc apply` fails on BuildRun | `generateName` + apply | Use `oc create` (Step 4 note) |
| Console BuildRun page blank/crash | OCPBUGS-84214 | Use CLI/`shp`; check OperatorHub for operator update |

### Legacy → Shipwright mapping (this migration)

| Legacy BuildConfig element | Shipwright equivalent |
|---|---|
| Inline `source.dockerfile` | `runtime/Dockerfile` in Git |
| base64 `entrypoint.sh` blob | `runtime/entrypoint.sh` in Git |
| `source.images[].paths` (chained image copy) | Multi-stage `COPY --from=builder` |
| `ImageStreamTag` output | `spec.output.image` + `pushSecret` |
| `ImageChange` trigger (builder → runtime) | Manual sequencing now; Tekton Pipeline chaining next |
| `noCache: true`, `forcePull: true` | Not in built-in strategy — add flags to `buildah-hl` script if needed (RFE BUILD-1746) |

